## Criteria and verdicts

For each unchanged request/plan criterion, emit one stable `DA-###` item in `## Criterion Verdicts` with `Criterion:`, `Expected observation:`, `Verdict:`, `Evidence:`, and `Location:`. `completed` requires every criterion to be `met` with evidence and no counterexample found. For `request_changes` or `failed`, mirror each localized non-met verdict in `## What Came Up Short`; do not request or prescribe a remedy. A `not evaluable` criterion requires `failed`.

## Decision artifact

Submit the final analysis artifact from this session. Read `.agent/artifact-formats/development_analysis_decision.md`. Include one evidence-citing `## Summary` item and the criterion verdict block; do not read or use development-result/history narrative as evidence.

